$ \-âr
*verbal infinitive marker :: kekâr :: to strike, hit*
*NOT an actual blow or strike:: that's with \-um*
*\-âr expresses the verbal action, it's grammatical not physical*

{:conlang.jagaranth.lexicon.-um.norg:}[see \-um]
